@startuml

title Smart Campus Study Room Booking - Revised Domain Class Diagram

class Student {
    - studentId : String
    + viewAvailability()
    + bookRoom(room : Room, startTime : DateTime, endTime : DateTime) : Booking
    + cancelOwnBooking(booking : Booking)
}

class Room {
    - roomId : String
    - blocked : Boolean
    + isAvailable(startTime : DateTime, endTime : DateTime) : Boolean
    + block()
    + unblock()
}

class Booking {
    - bookingId : String
    - startTime : DateTime
    - endTime : DateTime
    - status : String
    + cancel()
    + conflictsWith(other : Booking) : Boolean
    + hasValidTimeRange(now : DateTime) : Boolean
}

class Administrator {
    - administratorId : String
    + blockRoom(room : Room)
    + unblockRoom(room : Room)
    + reviewRoomUsage(startTime : DateTime, endTime : DateTime)
}

class Confirmation {
    - confirmationId : String
    - action : String
    - createdAt : DateTime
}

Student "1" -- "0..*" Booking : makes >
Room "1" -- "0..*" Booking : reserves >

Booking "1" -- "1..2" Confirmation : produces >

note right of Booking
R1: Start must be in the future.
Duration must be > 0 and <= 2 hours.

R2: Active bookings for the same
room must not overlap.

Assumption: bookings that only touch
at a boundary do not overlap.
end note

note right of Room
R3: A blocked room cannot
accept a new booking.

Assumption: blocking a room prevents
new bookings only. Existing bookings
remain unchanged.
end note

note right of Confirmation
R4: A successful booking
produces a confirmation.

US-06: successful cancellation
also produces confirmation.
end note

@enduml